  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Youth Advisory Board of the Embassy of the Kingdom of the Netherlands in Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EKN Maputo has established the Youth Advisory Board composed by seven young members with the role of advise the embassy on youth issues.
The board goal is to improve the design and implementation of youth sensitive programs and initiatives. This is done by consulting and integrating their views  in all embassy interventions. This is part of the meaningful youth participation agenda of the Kingdom of the Netherlands.
Following the initial rotation plan, part of the board members (three) will be substituted now in 2025. A new selection process took place to select three new young girls from the provinces of Maputo, Manica and Cabo Delgado.</narrative>
  </description>
